### Ping - Pong
GET {{host}}/api/v1/ping
Accept: application/json

### User Register
POST {{host}}/api/v1/user/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "email": "foo@bar.com",
    "first_name": "Foo",
    "last_name": "Bar",
    "plain_password": "test"
}

### User Login - Success
POST {{host}}/api/v1/user/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "foo@bar.com",
  "password": "test"
}

### User Login - Failure
POST {{host}}/api/v1/user/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "foo@bar.com",
  "password": "abc"
}
